---
import { businessScope } from '../data/business-scope';
---
<section class="business-scope" id="business-scope" aria-labelledby="business-scope-title">
  <p class="eyebrow">BUSINESS SCOPE</p>
  <h2 id="business-scope-title">完整经营范围</h2>
  <p class="scope-intro">经营范围按一般项目与许可项目分类列示，具体合作内容以双方确认的服务范围为准。</p>
  <details class="scope-disclosure">
    <summary><span>一般项目</span><span class="scope-count">{businessScope.general.length} 项<span aria-hidden="true"> ＋</span></span></summary>
    <ul class="scope-list">{businessScope.general.map(item => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul>
    <p class="scope-statement">{businessScope.generalStatement}</p>
  </details>
  <details class="scope-disclosure">
    <summary><span>许可项目</span><span class="scope-count">{businessScope.licensed.length} 项<span aria-hidden="true"> ＋</span></span></summary>
    <p class="scope-statement">{businessScope.licensedStatement}</p>
    <ul class="scope-list">{businessScope.licensed.map(item => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul>
  </details>
</section>
